 "insight": [
  "The value per kilogram of fuel imports in Luxembourg has increased from 0.54 euros in 2015 to 0.79 euros in 2025.",
  "This represents a 46.2% rise over the ten-year period.",
  "The highest value was recorded in 2023, reaching 0.93 euros per kilogram.",
  "The data shows a clear upward trend in fuel import prices over these years.",
  "However, the figures only include trade rows where quantities are known, so some volumes and unit values may be missing."
